SUMMARY:From The Inside Out
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Two comedians. Two unusual operating systems. One increasingly 
 baffling world. Charlotte "Chickie" Hickie and Mychelle Colleary compare no
 tes on invisible social rules\, baffling human behaviour and the exhausting
  performance of appearing normal. Expect sharp observational comedy\, glori
 ously sideways logic and the creeping suspicion that everybody else got an 
 instruction manual. If you've ever walked away from a conversation wonderin
 g what just happened\, this show is for you.\nMore info: https://comedyatla
 s.app/comedy-atlas/event/from-the-inside-out-26001/
